cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use this computational companion, please cite this repository release. Cite the associated research article separately when available."
title: "TB Undernutrition Proteomics Computational Companion"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rmaghembe1/tb-undernutrition-proteomics"
authors:
  - family-names: "Maghembe"
    given-names: "Reuben S."
abstract: "Portable publication-facing computational companion for longitudinal secondary analysis of serum proteomics during tuberculosis treatment across BMI-defined undernutrition strata. The repository contains sanitized aggregate outputs, a participant-independent curated module mapping, and the final four-stage analytical workflow."
keywords:
  - tuberculosis
  - undernutrition
  - serum proteomics
  - longitudinal analysis
  - nutritional-metabolic recovery
  - computational reproducibility
license: MIT
